{"title":"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 4</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A Bauman number is a positive integer each of whose digits is 1 or 2. Each Bauman number consists of blocks of digits. Each block contains at least one digit and includes all of the consecutive equal digits. For example, 2222111112111 is a 13-digit Bauman number consisting of four blocks: a block of four 2s, then a block of five 1s, then a block of one 2, then a block of three 1s; 2222222 is a 7-digit Bauman number consisting of a single block of seven 2s.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_4a\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4a\">2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_4b\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4b\">2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_4c&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4c (page does not exist)\">2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4c</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_4d&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4d (page does not exist)\">2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 4d</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005329\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35561:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005329 and revision id 277967. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}